{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n在最新一集《香港連場好戲》中，黎諾懿與賴慰玲（Winki）帶觀眾走訪多個經典電影取景地，當去到《毒舌大狀》的拍攝場地時，二人更戲癮大發，黎諾懿更搞笑自誇神似「子華神」，場面非常搞笑！\n</p>\n<h2>黎諾懿賴慰玲戲癮大發 扮法官律師</h2>\n<p>黎諾懿與賴慰玲來到北區的前粉嶺裁判法院，即電影《毒舌大狀》的取景地。二人似乎被電影的氣氛感染，即場戲癮大發，Winki扮起律師，而諾懿則坐上法官之位，維妙維肖。他們更忍不住瘋狂拍照，將法院變成了自己的舞台，玩得不亦樂乎。</p>\n<h2>黎諾懿搞笑自誇：影到子華神咁</h2>\n<p>當黎諾懿坐在莊嚴的法官席上拍照時，他忍不住開玩笑，對著鏡頭搞笑自誇：「影到子華神咁。」似乎對自己扮演法官的模樣相當滿意，更將自己比作電影主角黃子華（子華神），引來現場一陣爆笑，盡顯其幽默本色。</p>\n<h2>謝君豪現身分享感受：好似入到第二個世界</h2>\n<p>節目更請來有份演出《毒舌大狀》的謝君豪現身說法，分享在法院實景拍攝的感受。他表示在真實場景拍攝非常有幫助：「我覺得實感真係好好，成日感覺到好似入到去第二個世界咁。」謝君豪的分享讓觀眾更能體會到實景拍攝為電影帶來的真實感與張力。</p>\n<h2>走訪多個經典場景 重溫港產片足跡</h2>\n<p>除了前粉嶺裁判法院，Winki與諾懿亦先後帶觀眾走訪油尖旺區《旺角卡門》取景地油麻地果欄、以及沙田區《逆流大叔》取景地城門河等。著名導演陳詠燊亦現身節目，分享《逆流大叔》的拍攝靈感來源及啟發，帶領觀眾重溫多部經典港產片的足跡。</p>\n<h2>網民大讚節目有心思：好想跟住去</h2>\n<p>不少觀眾看完節目後都大讚製作有心思，紛紛留言：「諾懿扮法官好搞笑！」、「《毒舌大狀》真係好好睇，去實景一定好震撼！」、「有君豪sir分享，正！」、「呢個節目帶我哋重溫好多經典港產片！」、「好想跟住個list去打卡！」。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/27_14918895936af7ec286b31d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/27_14918895936af7ec286b31d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/29_21198581426af7ec3b73465.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/29_21198581426af7ec3b73465.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/31_15930964506af7ec4fd4acf.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/31_15930964506af7ec4fd4acf.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/32_8361656706af7ec58acfa2.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/32_8361656706af7ec58acfa2.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/14_14207737726af7ebb6b1fc7.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/14_14207737726af7ebb6b1fc7.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/15_9701275966af7ebbc664f6.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/15_9701275966af7ebbc664f6.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>《毒舌大狀》影評如何？票房將於何時破紀錄？<i></i></p>\n<p>《毒舌大狀》票房每日更新（<a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/%e6%af%92%e8%88%8c%e5%a4%a7%e7%8b%80-%e5%8a%a0%e9%95%b7%e7%89%88-%e9%bb%83%e5%ad%90%e8%8f%af-%e8%b7%8c%e5%80%92-plt9-1119683/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E6%AF%92%E8%88%8C%E5%A4%A7%E7%8B%80tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">按此看全文</a>）！以往香港賀歲檔期，幾乎都係大堆頭喜劇，容易忽視劇情意義，今次《毒舌大狀》就充滿談論話題 ，有影評點出當中<a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/%e6%af%92%e8%88%8c%e5%a4%a7%e7%8b%80-%e5%8a%a0%e9%95%b7%e7%89%88-%e9%bb%83%e5%ad%90%e8%8f%af-%e8%b7%8c%e5%80%92-plt9-1119683/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E6%AF%92%E8%88%8C%E5%A4%A7%E7%8B%80tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">7大必睇細節伏線</a>⋯⋯<a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/%e6%af%92%e8%88%8c%e5%a4%a7%e7%8b%80-%e5%8a%a0%e9%95%b7%e7%89%88-%e9%bb%83%e5%ad%90%e8%8f%af-%e8%b7%8c%e5%80%92-plt9-1119683/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E6%AF%92%E8%88%8C%E5%A4%A7%E7%8B%80tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">按此看全文</a></p>\n<p>《毒舌大狀》加長版預計有哪些情節披露？<i></i></p>\n<p>目前版本的《毒舌大狀》片長 2 小時 15 分鐘，但原來導演的初剪版本超過2 小時 35分鐘，當中備受討論的「加長版」情節包括⋯⋯<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/%E6%AF%92%E8%88%8C%E5%A4%A7%E7%8B%80-%E5%8A%A0%E9%95%B7%E7%89%88-%E5%88%AA%E9%8F%A1%E9%A0%AD-plt8-1457732/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E6%AF%92%E8%88%8C%E5%A4%A7%E7%8B%80tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">詳情請看</a></b></p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T13:25:41.173487+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":994,"images":6,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T13:00:13+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T15:00:20.667418+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T13:19:03.500763+00:00","content_hash":"628f85a0672a83e709ef500de316087d478f39b6a546bd111f1931672c219445","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}